{"person": {"slug": "stephanie-c-30b12031", "name": "Stephanie C.", "company": "Dexterity", "company_slug": "dexterityinc", "tier": "A", "reshares": 2, "offering": "product", "motion": "enterprise", "stage": "growth", "buyer": "exec"}, "n": 6, "n_reshared": 0, "posts": [{"type": "post", "id": "7490039511679168513", "linkedinUrl": "https://www.linkedin.com/posts/activity-7490039511679168513-mwI7", "content": "https://lnkd.in/gj7qwCgB\n\nExcited to share the next milestone in the FedEx and Dexterity journey!\nSince our initial collaboration announcement in 2023, the FedEx Global Planning, Engineering & Transformation - Advanced Technology & Innovation team has worked closely with Dexterity and partners across the business to evaluate, validate, and operationalize autonomous trailer loading. Today's announcement marks an important step forward as we expand deployment at our Hagerstown Hub, building on years of testing, learning, and operational experience.\n \nI'm incredibly proud of the AT&I team - Steven Schwartzberg, John Barron, Amanda Noe and Nate LeMar - for leading this effort from early evaluation through deployment planning and execution. Innovation is about more than proving technology works. It's about creating solutions that safely integrate into operations and deliver lasting value for our network, team members, and customers. Looking forward to what's next.\n#FedEx #Innovation #PhysicalAI #Robotics #Automation", "contentAttributes": [{"start": 595, "length": 19, "type": "PROFILE_MENTION", "hyperlink": null, "textLink": null, "profile": {"id": "ACoAAAAPhGsBdCikjlBDNJ4xpZnpiHdNelAphtQ", "firstName": "Steven", "lastName": "Schwartzberg", "linkedinUrl": "https://www.linkedin.com/in/steven-schwartzberg-60b410", "publicIdentifier": "steven-schwartzberg-60b410"}}, {"start": 629, "length": 10, "type": "PROFILE_MENTION", "hyperlink": null, "textLink": null, "profile": {"id": "ACoAAARtzcwBkMGJrHutC5S5zPTvvE0Ym7zL5ak", "firstName": "Amanda", "lastName": "Noe", "link